---
import Prose from "../../layouts/Prose.astro";
import { ANIME, href } from "../../lib/site.mjs";
import { FONTS } from "../../../../packages/appearance/registry.js";
import { FIXTURE } from "../../../../packages/preview/views.js";
---
<Prose title="Credits and licenses · GitHub Reskin" heading="Credits and licenses" description="Fonts, preview content, theme inspirations and licenses used by GitHub Reskin and this site." path="credits/">
  <h2>Theme inspirations</h2>
  <p>Each theme is named for the anime that inspired it, and has its own original name, colors and decoration. GitHub Reskin uses no artwork, logos, title treatments, characters, screenshots, dialogue or music from these series, and is not affiliated with or endorsed by their creators or rights holders. Series titles are set as plain text. All trademarks belong to their owners.</p>
  <ul>
    {ANIME.map((t) => <li><b>{t.anime}</b>: {t.name}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <h2>Classic palettes</h2>
  <p>The Classics follow palettes from their open-source projects: Dracula, Nord, Catppuccin, Gruvbox, Tokyo Night, Rosé Pine, One Dark and Solarized. Editing Suite is original to GitHub Reskin.</p>

  <h2>Interactive preview</h2>
  <p>The preview shows public content from <span>github.com/{FIXTURE.profile.login}</span>, captured offline on November 8, 2026, with the owner's permission. It is a frozen copy, not live activity, and this site makes no requests to GitHub. The README, avatars and organization logos belong to their owners. The GitHub Reskin repository text is MIT licensed (<a href={href("licenses/LICENSE-GitHub-Reskin.txt")}>license</a>). The README's stats panel embeds Chakra Petch (<a href={href("licenses/OFL-Chakra-Petch.txt")}>license</a>) and JetBrains Mono (<a href={href("licenses/OFL-JetBrains-Mono.txt")}>license</a>). The preview is an independent reconstruction for demonstration and is not GitHub's own interface. The pictures of each theme on this site are rendered from that same preview.</p>

  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <p>The GitHub Reskin wordmark and headings use Manrope by the Manrope Project Authors, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (<a href={href("licenses/manrope-OFL.txt")}>license</a>). This site bundles a Latin subset. Body text uses your system's font.</p>
  <p>Theme fonts bundled with GitHub Reskin, each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:</p>
  <ul>
    {FONTS.map((font) => <li>{font.family} (<a href={href(font.license)}>license</a>)</li>)}
  </ul>

  <h2>Icon and graphics</h2>
  <p>The GitHub Reskin icon and the small interface icons were drawn for this project by Sideband Studio. They contain no GitHub marks or franchise artwork.</p>

  <h2>Software</h2>
  <p>This site is built with Astro. GitHub Reskin is MIT licensed; its source and third-party notices are in the repository.</p>
</Prose>
